0216                         ; Prints a space on both consoles (preserves A)
0217                         ; -----------------------------------------------------
0218 02ec 36                 PRSPB   PSHA
0219 02ed 86 20                      LDAA    #$20        ; Put space character in A
0220 02ef bd fc 0f                   JSR     PR_A
0221 02f2 bd 02 ac                   JSR     PR_B        ; Print it
0222 02f5 32                         PULA
0223 02f6 39                         RTS                 ; RETURN
